    {
      "text": "I take away my first blessing, 2 Ne. 1:29. last that they may be first, and that the first, Jacob 5:63. ye are not guilty of the first offense, Alma 43:46. Father having raised me up unto you first, 3 Ne. 20:26.",
      "references": [
